.git
.github
.claude
# …except the coordinator's skills. `.claude/skills/next-issue` holds the
# preflight decision table next to the procedure it describes, and
# `packages/cli/test/preflight-tier.test.ts` reads both to prove they agree — a
# review image without them can only skip that suite. Everything else under
# `.claude` (worktrees, local settings) stays out.
!.claude/skills
!.claude/skills/**
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
data
**/data
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-*
*.sqlite3
*.db
.env
.env.*
test-results
playwright-report
.DS_Store
.vite


# A developer's derived mise config carries HUB_AUTH_TOKEN. It is gitignored,
# so `mise run review` (which builds from `git archive`) never sees it — but a
# plain `docker build` from a working checkout would otherwise bake the signing
# secret into an image that is published publicly.
mise.local.toml
